<title>POLAND: PPABank plans no 1996 payout.</title>
<headline>PPABank plans no 1996 payout.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish bank Pierwszy Polsko-Amerykanski Bank SA (PPABank) plans no 1996 dividend, the bank said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>PPABank said management's proposal would be voted on at a general shareholders meeting on June 26.</p>
<p>PPABank made a net profit of 9.1 million zlotys last year.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
